  tri45all           1309 / 1309          992      k<=3
  eu-half-hex-v        21 / 21            344      k<=3
  eu-half-sq-mid        1 / 1            4485      k<=4
  eu-half-hex-m         1 / 1               6      k<=4
  eu-half-pent          8 / 8               0      k<=4
  eu-half-oct-m         - (empty)            0      k<=4

--- SHIPPED: the shelf rebuilt on divided edges ---------------------------------------------------
Deeper runs: hexv k<=6, sqmid k<=6, hexm k<=9, pent k<=9. Above those the split palette costs too
much depth, so the shelf takes the split records up to the ceiling and the ORIGINAL edge-to-edge
records above it (`cellsEdgeToEdge` in the builder) — the alternative was shipping a shelf shallower
than the one it replaces, which would have deleted ~25,000 tilings to add a few hundred.

